---
source: misc/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"waitpid\")"
---
Wait for arbitrary processes to exit

Usage: waitpid [OPTIONS] <PIDS>...

Arguments:
  <PIDS>...  PIDs to wait for. Each may be a plain `PID` or the race-free `PID:INODE` form produced
             by `getino -p`

Options:
  -v, --verbose            Be more verbose
  -t, --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Maximum number of seconds to wait (fractional values allowed)
  -e, --exited             Don't error on already-exited PIDs
  -c, --count <COUNT>      Number of process exits to wait for
  -h, --help               Print help
